  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JORDANIAN PSYCHIATRIC REHABILITATION SAFSAF CENTRE SANITARY KITCHEN RENOVATION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An ICMPS grant of &#x20ac;10,645 was given to Jordanian non-profit,  non-governmental organization JPRS, to conduct a project entitled the &apos;Renovating and Maintaining a Safe and Sanitary Kitchen at the Centre&apos;. JPRS is the only centre in Jordan providing a rehabilitation programme for persons recovering from addiction, psychiatric episodes (depression, schizophrenia etc.), and survivors of violence. This grant will be used to renovate the kitchen, which is the heart of the centre, and will improve standards for safe and sanitary kitchens in mental health facilities, which are are essential to ensure that beneficiaries receive adequate nutrition and maintain their physical health.</narrative>
  </description>
